    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11475" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crasso</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, ātum, 1,
				v. a.
			crassus, <i>to make thick, thicken,
				condense</i> (postclass.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pili crassantur in setas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 3, p. 139, 39</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crassatus aër,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 19, 4, 6</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">19, 4, 8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">20, 3, 5</span></i>.</div>
